sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant S as AiSmartAnalysisScene<br/>SmartScanFlowController
  participant R as FrameReader<br/>(ML Kit, Java)
  participant I as ProductRepository<br/>ProductIndex (phone)
  participant F as Firestore
  participant G as Gemini API
  participant L as LoadingScene<br/>ScanAnalysisPipeline
  participant X as FDA PH portal /<br/>Open Beauty Facts
  U->>S: tap Start Scan
  loop each good camera frame
    S->>R: upright picture
    R-->>S: text lines, confidence, barcode
    S->>I: barcode / name in text?
  end
  alt product known with list
    I-->>S: ProductData + ingredients
  else not on phone
    S->>F: products where brand + name (FindByBrandAndNameAsync)
    F-->>S: product or nothing
    S->>F: pending_products own entry (FindAsync)
    S->>G: Identify(photo) + ConfirmOnWeb (AiBudget 2 + 2)
    G-->>S: identity + sourced list, or a question
  end
  S->>L: GoViaLoading(analysis)
  L->>L: ProductAnalysisEngine.Analyse (profile on phone)
  par beside the analysis
    L->>X: FDA PH search (12-15 s), OBF by barcode
  and unknown ingredients
    L->>G: IngredientResearcher (names only)
    L->>F: create ingredients/ai_... (reviewed false)
  end
  L->>F: users/uid/scans (SyncQueue), scanActivity note, scans +1
  L-->>U: AiSmartAnalysisResultScene
